Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: winex11: Enlarge application cursors for the DPI.
 System cursors come from the Xcursor theme at the size set in
 Xcursor.size. Cursors that an application loads from its own resources
 were passed to the X server at their bitmap size, a third or a half of
 the theme cursors at 144 and 192 DPI. Enlarge them by a whole factor
 with pixel replication.
Last-Modified: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:28:12 +0300

--- a/src/dlls/winex11.drv/mouse.c
+++ b/src/dlls/winex11.drv/mouse.c
@@ -1059,12 +1059,12 @@
